  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 yubakiye ku nkoranyabumenyi z'ubuntu zanditswe n'abantu. Ziri hano kubera ko zitakozwe na AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ni umushinga wakozwe wose na AI.<\/0> Umurongo wose w'inkoranyabumenyi ya Orion-81 ubwayo wanditswe na Claude Code, uyobowe n'uwashinze. Ubwato bwose, ikarata yose, ishusho yo hejuru yose n'ijwi ryose vyakozwe n'ibikoresho Claude Code yanditse. Uwashinze ni we agena ico kubaka; Claude Code ni yo ibona uko vyokorwa. Inkoranyabumenyi z'ubuntu yubakiyeko ziri hasi mu gice 'Bitakozwe na AI'. Ikintu kimwe kiracaguma gifunguye kandi cerekanywe ku mugaragaro: <1>isuzuma ry'uruhusha<\/1> rw'inkoranyabumenyi y'umukino yavuye kuri prototype ya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion yatanguye ku wa 28 Nyakanga 2026 ari prototype ku moteri y'ubuntu ya Quake III Arena (GPL), ifise amato ya Elite Dangerous nk'isôko y'ivyiyumviro. Ku musi wa kabiri inkoranyabumenyi y'umukino yimukiye kuri BuB, moteri nshasha yanditswe na Claude Code; ibice vy'umukino vyavuye kuri prototype maze bihindurirwa amazina. Verisiyo 0.3.0 yahaye ibwoko vyose 16 vy'amato imibiri mishasha yabyo bwite. Isuzuma ry'ukubahiriza uruhusha ririko riraraba niba hari inkoranyabumenyi yaba igikomoka ku ya GPL ya mbere, n'iyaba ibishushanyo vya mbere vy'amato vyegereye cane ivyabihaye ivyiyumviro. Igipimo ca mudasobwa c'ukuhuza kw'inkoranyabumenyi n'inkomoko ya prototype ya GPL cakozwe ku wa 8 Gitugutu 2026, kandi isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ivyabonetse riracaba ririko. Icose cakomotse ku yindi kizoyandikwa bushasha canke gishushanywe bushasha.",
