  "economy.todayHead": "Ivyiho uyu musi",
  "economy.todayLead": "Ingero z'umubiri n'iz'ingabo n'amabara y'ingabo vyo ku kibaho ca LOADOUT (0.6.0) vyerekana ubwoko bw'ivyongerewe n'ibirimbisho ubukungu bugenewe gutanga.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Kubera ko amahera uzoronka agenewe kubishura. Umukino utangura wakozwe wose na AI kugira ushobore kuba, maze abakora ibishushanyo bishurwa bagasubirira akazi ka AI, bavuzwe izina.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Nshobora gukina kuri interineti?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Gukina ni ubuntu?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ibibazo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Oya, ntirirashika. Gukina muri LAN ku muyoboro umwe birakora uyu musi (kuva kuri 0.2.0); gukina kuri interineti ntirirakorwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype yubatswe kuri moteri y'ubuntu ya Quake III Arena (GPL) maze ifata amato ya Elite Dangerous nk'isôko y'ivyiyumviro. Ku musi wa kabiri inkoranyabumenyi y'umukino yimukiye kuri BuB, moteri nshasha yanditswe na Claude Code; ibice vy'umukino vyavuye kuri prototype maze bihindurirwa amazina. Verisiyo 0.3.0 yahaye ibwoko vyose 16 vy'amato imibiri mishasha. Isuzuma ry'ukubahiriza uruhusha ririko riraraba niba hari inkoranyabumenyi yaba igikomoka ku ya GPL ya mbere kandi niba ibishushanyo vya mbere vy'amato vyegereye cane ivyabihaye ivyiyumviro. Igipimo ca mudasobwa c'ukuhuza kw'inkoranyabumenyi n'inkomoko ya prototype ya GPL cakozwe ku wa <0/>, kandi isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ivyabonetse riracaba ririko. Icose cakomotse ku yindi kizoyandikwa bushasha canke gishushanywe bushasha. Gushika isuzuma rirangiye, ntitwemeza ko igisubizo ari oya.",
  "faq.questions": "Ibibazo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Amato, ibishushanyo, ububonano n'ibindi, uko amahera yemera. <0>Igitabu c'kuri uru rupapuro<\/0> gitondekanya buri kintu kandi kizoyerekana buri gisubirira n'uwagikoze.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Biteganijwe ko amato n'ivyongerewe bizoshobora kuronkwa mu gukina canke kugurwa. Uko amato yishuwe asigara aringaniye mu kurwana kw'abakinnyi hagati yabo biracakorwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Uwo ni umugambi: gukina ni ubuntu hamwe n'amahera yo mu mukino n'ibirimbisho bishobora kugurwa. Ntivirakorwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Hari akazi k'umuntu kakopowe?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Uzosohoka ryari, kandi ku ki?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ni ibihe bice abantu bazosubirira, kandi nzobimenya nte?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kubera iki umukino wakozwe na AI wofasha abakora ibishushanyo?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Uzoba umukino wo kwishura kugira utsinde?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC ya Windows. Nta tariki yo gusohokeraho canke igiciro biraboneka.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code ni ibirango vya Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games ni ibirango vya Epic Games, Inc. Blender ni ikirango ca Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous ni ibirango vy'abavyiganzwe. Amazina yose ni ay'abayafise kandi akoreshwa gusa mu kuranga ivyo avuga. Orion-81 ntifitaniye isano, ntishigikiwe kandi ntiyemejwe n'uwo ari wese muri bo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ni icifuzo gusa. Nta bufatanye, isano canke ugushigikirwa bihari.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Umuyoboro uraza",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog kuri YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Kurikira Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Abafatanyabikorwa b'ejo hazoza?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Nta bikurikirana. Nta cookie. Urubuga rw'igerageza. Buri kintu cose kijanye n'ububiko bw'umushinga; nta kintu na kimwe hano ni igitangwa canke isezerano.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ntiriraba",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ikintu kimwe kiracafunguye: <0>isuzuma ry'uruhusha<\/0> ry'inkoranyabumenyi y'umukino yavuye kuri prototype ya GPL. Igipimo ca mudasobwa c'ukuhuza kw'inkoranyabumenyi n'inkomoko ya prototype cakozwe ku wa <1/>, kandi isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ivyabonetse riracaba ririko.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ni umushinga wakozwe wose na AI.<\/0> Inkoranyabumenyi ya Orion-81 ubwayo yakozwe na Claude Code, iyobowe n'uwashinze; amato, amakarata, amashusho yo hejuru n'amajwi vyakozwe n'ibikoresho Claude Code yanditse. Inkoranyabumenyi z'ubuntu ikoresha ziri mu gice <1>'Bitakozwe na AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Ibiri hasi y'urubuga",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Inyuma y'iki kibaho: ishusho y'ORION-1 yo mu mukino yo muri verisiyo 0.6.1, iriko iraremwa mu buryo bwa nyabwo muri brawuzeri yawe (yahinduwe kugira ikore ku rubuga, ishusho yo hejuru yagabanijwe kugera kuri 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Inyuma y'iki kibaho: ifoto yo mu mukino yo muri verisiyo 0.6.1. 3D ikorana nawe ntiriko kuri iki gikoresho.",
  "hero.exploreShips": "Raba amato",
  "hero.followKickstarter": "Kurikira Kickstarter",
  "hero.groundedSixDegrees": "Intambara yo mu kirere ikorwa mu buryo busanzwe, ifise ubwisanzure mu ngendo itandatu, kuva ku ndwanyi ya m 12 gushika ku bwato bukuru bwa km 1.2.",
  "hero.n100AiGenerated": "100 % VYAKOZWE NA AI  ·  0 % VYAKOZWE N'ABANTU KUGEZA UBU",
