  "hero.oneItemStill": "Ikintu kimwe kiracaguma gifunguye kandi cerekanywe ku mugaragaro: <0>isuzuma ry'uruhusha rw'inkoranyabumenyi y'umukino yavuye kuri prototype ya GPL<\/0>.",
