  "why.anthropic": "Kuri Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Economic Index ya Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> isanga ko abakozi bakiri mu ntango y'akazi kabo babona ko igice kinini c'akazi kabo gishobora gukorwa na AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Ingene ya Anthropic y'amategeko y'ubukungu (<1/>)<\/0> isaba ibigo gusubiza abantu mu masomo no kubimura aho gukuraho akazi kabo.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Isuzuma rya Anthropic ry'ibimenyetso vyo gusubiza mu masomo (<1/>)<\/0> risanga ko gahunda zifatanije n'abakoresha kandi zihariye ku rwego zikora neza kuruta izindi.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Icibazo ni cyoroshe: intebe zitanu za Claude gutangura. Uwashinze nashobora kuzuzamwo abantu bafise impano kandi bafise umwete, tuzoyerekana uko AI ishobora gukoreshwa mu migambi myiza kugira hakorwe ikintu c'igitangaza.",
  "why.context": "Imiterere",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Ku bakora ibishushanyo n'abakora porogaramu",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Buri kintu cose kiri hasi ni umugambi canke ntikiratangazwa. Nta kintu na kimwe hano cumvikanyweho, kandi nta mubare wasezeranywe.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Uwashinze yavuye kuri prototype gushika kuri 0.6.1 mu misi <0/>. Tekereza ivyo itsinda ry'abantu batanu bitanga ryokora.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Kuva kuri Anthropic",
  "why.fromBackers": "Kuva ku bashigikiye",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Umukino wakozwe na AI wabwiwe abantu mu buryo bwuzuye, ufise intumbero abakinnyi bashobora gusuzuma, uteganijwe kwimukira kuri Unreal Engine 5 (igice ca 3 c'urugendo).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Urugero rwanditswe mu buryo bwuzuye rw'ubwubatsi bukorwa na AI ubwayo, kuva kuri moteri gushika ku mukino (ububiko, urutonde rw'imirimo n'amaverisiyo yose yabitswe vyarabitswe), n'igerageza rito rifise akamaro rya rumwe mu buryo inyungu za AI zishobora gufasha abo ihoza ku nkombe.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Intumbero y'amahera: izotangazwa.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Kickstarter (igice ca 5 c'urugendo) ni igice ca mbere co gukusanya amahera mu ruhame. Amahera yayo agenewe guha akazi abakora porogaramu n'abakora ibishushanyo ba mbere bahomvye akazi kubera AI (igice ca 6), bazosubirira ivyakozwe na AI kimwe ku kindi. <0>Ico igice ca mbere kizokwishurira, umurimo ku wundi: izotangazwa.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Imiyoboro itangwa gusa kugira habeho imiterere kandi ntivuga ko hariho ugushigikirwa.",
  "why.n06WhyMatters": "06 · Impamvu bifise akamaro",
  "why.orion81Tests": "Orion-81 igerageza verisiyo imwe nto y'ico gitekerezo. Ni umugambi, nta bakozi barahabwa akazi.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Biteganijwe: akazi kishurwa kandi gashimwa izina gasubirira ivyakozwe na AI kimwe ku kindi, uko amahera yemera.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Ku bashingantahe n'abakora moteri",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Inzira zihari muri gahunda z'ahabona za Anthropic zirimwo Claude for Startups (ingurane n'amasaha y'inama ya Applied AI) n'ibirori bya Claude Founder House. Orion-81 yoshobora kandi kuba ikibanza c'ubushakashatsi ku bariko barigira ku gusubira ku kazi gukoreshwa n'amahera ya AI. Nta masezerano canke ugushigikirwa bihari.",
